WEBVTT

00:00:05.434 --> 00:00:08.335
The Irresponsible Captain
Tylor

00:00:09.104 --> 00:00:11.974
We may be off the maps...
Chizu ni Nai Tabi Tsuzukeyou

00:00:11.974 --> 00:00:14.033
...but let's stay on this voyage.
Chizu ni Nai Tabi Tsuzukeyou

00:00:14.877 --> 00:00:19.007
I will be holding, never let you go.

00:00:20.582 --> 00:00:23.418
Whatever we may want...
Hoshimono wa Tsukamu no sa

00:00:23.418 --> 00:00:25.545
...we'll take as we need.
Hoshimono wa Tsukamu no sa

00:00:26.321 --> 00:00:30.348
So let's just go wherever we please!
Omoi no Mama Yukou!

00:00:32.060 --> 00:00:34.830
Make me your partner...
Kotoba yori Tashikana Koto

00:00:34.830 --> 00:00:37.458
...on this journey.
Kotoba yori Tashikana Koto

00:00:37.733 --> 00:00:41.328
One that you trust more than words!
Michizure ni Shite

00:00:42.771 --> 00:00:47.435
Come on now and sail away for future!
Imasugu sail away for future

00:00:48.443 --> 00:00:49.945
Things are waiting...
Mishiranu Nanika ga Matteru sa

00:00:49.945 --> 00:00:53.142
...that we've never seen before!
Mishiranu Nanika ga Matteru sa

00:00:54.983 --> 00:00:57.152
Just take your cares...
Kodawari Minna Sutetara

00:00:57.152 --> 00:01:01.213
...and throw them all away.
Kodawari Minna Sutetara

00:01:01.456 --> 00:01:06.086
Come together, just think of tomorrow.

00:01:07.863 --> 00:01:09.353
Let's go!

00:01:12.734 --> 00:01:15.999
MIND'S EYE, HALF BLIND,
HEADED FOR A ROUGH RIDE

00:01:48.237 --> 00:01:50.432
Now beginning
targeting practice.

00:01:50.906 --> 00:01:52.498
Difficulty level is
set to class-A special.

00:01:52.574 --> 00:01:55.042
If you shoot this down,
your name will be recorded...

00:01:55.110 --> 00:01:57.101
...with history's greatest
pilots, Kojiro.

00:02:09.524 --> 00:02:11.549
Okay... Today I'm gonna do it!

00:02:16.465 --> 00:02:17.056
Gotcha!

00:02:22.537 --> 00:02:23.367
Damn!

00:02:45.160 --> 00:02:47.754
They may be training lasers,
but don't underestimate them!

00:02:47.963 --> 00:02:51.262
Get real! Learning to dodge
those is a pilot's first step!

00:02:58.273 --> 00:03:01.242
Just what I'd expect from a
top-level military academy...

00:03:01.310 --> 00:03:03.778
...flight school graduate
like Ensign Kojiro Sakai.

00:03:04.246 --> 00:03:06.146
Even with the shame
of being downgraded...

00:03:06.214 --> 00:03:07.943
...he never stops
his daily training.

00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:12.380
I wish a little of that spirit
would rub off onto the captain.

00:03:23.265 --> 00:03:27.429
Oh, so that's your game?
Well, I send in my general!

00:03:29.671 --> 00:03:30.968
You fell for it.

00:03:31.340 --> 00:03:35.333
I counter with
a clear-eyed spy!

00:03:38.347 --> 00:03:42.147
You tricked me. You really
do have good insight.

00:03:45.987 --> 00:03:48.615
But, then, you are a
pretty good judge of people.

00:03:48.990 --> 00:03:50.184
Who? Me?

00:03:50.692 --> 00:03:53.786
With a little alcohol in me,
I'm the best surgeon in space.

00:03:54.029 --> 00:03:58.090
But no ship I was on before
ever allowed me to drink openly.

00:03:58.300 --> 00:04:01.326
Because of that, I never did
a good job on those ships.

00:04:05.707 --> 00:04:10.201
Letting me drink means you have
the eye for judging people.

00:04:10.412 --> 00:04:11.970
The eye for judging people...

00:04:12.247 --> 00:04:14.010
Do you mean... THIS eye?

00:04:14.082 --> 00:04:17.415
Exactly! Your own
spying clear eye!

00:04:19.020 --> 00:04:19.952
You think so?

00:04:21.256 --> 00:04:23.622
Can Tylor really
judge others well?

00:04:26.361 --> 00:04:29.956
Too bad, Ensign.
You almost got it this time.

00:04:30.265 --> 00:04:32.529
Just get me the
flight data to look over.

00:04:32.701 --> 00:04:33.395
Roger.

00:04:37.339 --> 00:04:38.738
Mr. Kojiro!

00:04:39.241 --> 00:04:41.573
Hold it! Don't come
any closer to me!

00:04:44.379 --> 00:04:48.839
But we want to ask you
a favor, Mr. Kojiro!

00:04:49.384 --> 00:04:50.078
From me?

00:04:51.052 --> 00:04:53.247
You want to be fighter pilots?!

00:04:54.756 --> 00:04:56.451
Are you two serious?

00:04:56.758 --> 00:04:57.986
Yes, very serious.

00:04:58.093 --> 00:05:00.323
But when we asked Mr. Kojiro...

00:05:00.395 --> 00:05:03.331
...he said it was up
to the senior officers.

00:05:03.331 --> 00:05:08.325
But you're both Admiral
Hanner's precious daughters.

00:05:08.403 --> 00:05:11.206
And with a fine pilot like
Ensign Kojiro on board...

00:05:11.206 --> 00:05:13.697
...there's no reason for
you to risk going into combat.

00:05:13.842 --> 00:05:16.675
But we want to fly a plane!

00:05:16.745 --> 00:05:19.213
We're tired of just
using the simulator!

00:05:20.115 --> 00:05:20.979
Right?

00:05:21.116 --> 00:05:21.980
But!

00:05:24.519 --> 00:05:25.417
This is...

00:05:27.689 --> 00:05:28.781
...highly...

00:05:29.458 --> 00:05:30.652
What's this, Ensign?

00:05:31.126 --> 00:05:34.425
It's a flight program
aptitude test used by...

00:05:34.930 --> 00:05:37.160
...the United Planets
Space Force Academy.

00:05:37.499 --> 00:05:40.730
It's normally administered
by an instructor...

00:05:40.802 --> 00:05:42.133
...but I gave it to them myself.

00:05:42.471 --> 00:05:45.565
You tested their
piloting aptitude?

00:05:45.807 --> 00:05:46.330
Yes, ma'am.

00:05:54.749 --> 00:05:57.616
You both scored "D"s
on your aptitude tests.

00:05:57.819 --> 00:06:01.255
There's no way you could be
allowed to fly fighters.

00:06:01.323 --> 00:06:03.314
What?!
But that's not fair!

00:06:04.059 --> 00:06:06.823
We didn't come
here for a picnic!

00:06:06.962 --> 00:06:10.295
We came aboard the
Soyokaze to be pilots...

00:06:10.432 --> 00:06:11.592
...even if we are just trainees!

00:06:12.100 --> 00:06:15.900
Our destiny was decided
the day we were born!

00:06:17.038 --> 00:06:20.439
We're to spread our great wings and
soar through the vastness of space!

00:06:20.876 --> 00:06:22.776
Telling us that one wish
can't be granted...

00:06:22.844 --> 00:06:24.778
...is like telling
us to drop dead!

00:06:24.913 --> 00:06:26.471
What?! Don't be ridiculous!

00:06:26.548 --> 00:06:28.516
Guys, just give it up.

00:06:28.717 --> 00:06:30.116
No, don't say
"just give it up!"

00:06:30.185 --> 00:06:31.743
Say "drop dead!"

00:06:31.820 --> 00:06:33.117
Stop it, both of you!

00:06:33.188 --> 00:06:34.951
What's with this "B"?

00:06:35.524 --> 00:06:37.048
It's a "D," not a "B"!

00:06:37.459 --> 00:06:38.255
A "D"?

00:06:38.527 --> 00:06:39.619
Mr. Tylor!

00:06:40.529 --> 00:06:42.690
You understand,
don't you, Mr. Tylor?

00:06:42.764 --> 00:06:43.321
Huh?

00:06:43.565 --> 00:06:45.897
We want to fly fighters!

00:06:46.001 --> 00:06:47.059
Fighters?

00:06:47.202 --> 00:06:49.136
Yes! To spread our great wings...

00:06:49.204 --> 00:06:51.297
...and soar through
the vastness of space!

00:06:51.473 --> 00:06:54.442
It's our destiny!
We want to fly!

00:06:54.576 --> 00:06:55.338
We want to fly!

00:06:55.877 --> 00:06:57.504
We want to fly, PLEASE!

00:06:58.880 --> 00:07:01.041
Well, sure. If you
want to do it so badly.

00:07:01.850 --> 00:07:02.782
YAY!

00:07:03.485 --> 00:07:05.112
What are you saying, Captain?!

00:07:05.220 --> 00:07:08.815
They both have horrible
pilot aptitude scores!

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:09.922
Aptitude?

00:07:10.892 --> 00:07:13.452
But how do you know how well
you'll do till you do it?

00:07:13.528 --> 00:07:16.827
I mean, they said I had a horrible
aptitude for being a captain!

00:07:16.998 --> 00:07:18.022
I rest my case!

00:07:18.500 --> 00:07:20.365
I say let them try.

00:07:21.169 --> 00:07:23.103
How can you say that, Ensign?!

00:07:23.204 --> 00:07:24.262
Mr. Kojiro!

00:07:24.873 --> 00:07:27.740
However,
as their superior officer...

00:07:27.909 --> 00:07:31.470
No, as the only pilot on board,
I'll make one condition.

00:07:31.713 --> 00:07:32.611
Condition?

00:07:35.584 --> 00:07:38.883
If there's any sort of trouble
on their first flight...

00:07:39.254 --> 00:07:41.347
...the two pilot trainees
will be dismissed...

00:07:41.423 --> 00:07:44.051
...and they're to never lay a
finger on a plane again.

00:07:44.259 --> 00:07:45.317
"That's my condition..."

00:07:45.927 --> 00:07:47.087
...is what I told them.

00:07:47.262 --> 00:07:48.889
Just like you, Ensign.

00:07:49.431 --> 00:07:51.763
Everyone has some sort of
trouble on their first flight.

00:07:52.567 --> 00:07:55.468
I'll finally be rid of
those two annoying girls!

00:07:55.904 --> 00:07:58.532
I'm impressed you take
your woman-hating this far.

00:07:58.607 --> 00:07:59.801
It's more than that.

00:08:02.243 --> 00:08:03.210
It's my battlefield.

00:08:04.579 --> 00:08:06.945
Space is my
glorious battlefield.

00:08:07.949 --> 00:08:10.247
And I won't let those
stupid girls ruin it!

00:08:48.990 --> 00:08:51.151
Standing by. Okay to launch!

00:08:51.960 --> 00:08:53.291
Okay over here, too.

00:09:13.014 --> 00:09:14.504
Main booster, on!

00:09:18.453 --> 00:09:21.183
The plane's really
shaking me around!

00:09:21.523 --> 00:09:23.787
The stabilizer system button
is in here somewhere.

00:09:28.029 --> 00:09:30.088
Hm, still not very steady.

00:09:30.632 --> 00:09:32.998
Must be nice to be
so fresh and innocent!

00:09:34.803 --> 00:09:39.934
Captain! If anything happens
to them, you'll be responsible!

00:09:40.375 --> 00:09:41.535
Do you understand that?!

00:09:42.410 --> 00:09:43.934
"D"s! They both got "D"s!

00:09:44.312 --> 00:09:46.075
You're such worrywarts.

00:09:46.948 --> 00:09:50.406
Here it is. I think this
is the stabilizer button.

00:09:51.286 --> 00:09:52.753
This will
settle things down.

00:10:17.011 --> 00:10:18.000
Those idiots!

00:10:18.413 --> 00:10:22.315
They mistook the afterburner
limiter cutoff for the stabilizer!

00:10:22.684 --> 00:10:24.345
"To Mr. Kojiro"
EMI and YUMI

00:10:30.759 --> 00:10:32.158
This isn't some kids' game!

00:10:50.111 --> 00:10:53.103
If those two come back alive,
there'll be hell to pay!

00:10:53.414 --> 00:10:55.382
I warned you, didn't I?!

00:10:55.717 --> 00:10:58.117
Form a rescue party
and go out after them?!

00:10:58.453 --> 00:10:59.920
Get real!

00:11:00.121 --> 00:11:04.785
It'd be impossible, even for
invincible Marines like us.

00:11:05.059 --> 00:11:06.151
You can't mean that!

00:11:06.427 --> 00:11:08.725
I really want to
go and save them...

00:11:08.897 --> 00:11:11.331
...but our dropship just
isn't fast enough.

00:11:11.399 --> 00:11:12.229
What he said.

00:11:12.400 --> 00:11:14.027
DonвЂ™t just say "what he said!"

00:11:14.135 --> 00:11:16.660
Ensign Kojiro scrambling
out there is the only option.

00:11:16.905 --> 00:11:18.202
We'll have to wait and hope.

00:11:18.640 --> 00:11:21.370
We've got trouble!
The Shinryus' course!

00:11:21.476 --> 00:11:22.443
Put it on screen!

00:11:34.189 --> 00:11:35.816
Damn, this isn't good!

00:11:36.691 --> 00:11:38.750
If they get caught
in that gravity field...

00:11:39.027 --> 00:11:41.188
...they'll never
be able to get out!

00:11:52.140 --> 00:11:54.734
This is Ranpu!
Come in, Shinryu!

00:11:55.343 --> 00:11:57.573
This is Ranpu!
Come in, Shinryu!

00:12:01.516 --> 00:12:03.814
This is Ranpu!
Come in, Shinryu!

00:12:04.819 --> 00:12:06.912
This is Shinryu...
We read you.

00:12:07.789 --> 00:12:09.814
Shinryu...
Shinryu, is that really you?!

00:12:10.258 --> 00:12:10.917
Yes!

00:12:11.960 --> 00:12:14.451
Okay, if you two want
to get back alive...

00:12:14.662 --> 00:12:16.653
...then do exactly
what I tell you to.

00:12:17.165 --> 00:12:19.725
This is great!
It's the first time...

00:12:19.801 --> 00:12:22.668
...Mr. Kojiro ever wanted
to teach us how to fly!

00:12:22.904 --> 00:12:26.237
We've been waiting
so long for this day!

00:12:26.574 --> 00:12:28.405
Just shut your mouths
and listen to me!

00:12:30.378 --> 00:12:33.939
You're already inside the gravity
field of that planetoid ahead.

00:12:34.449 --> 00:12:36.041
You have only one
chance to break away!

00:12:37.051 --> 00:12:39.815
Your only way out is to
follow my instructions...

00:12:39.888 --> 00:12:41.219
...and perform a gravity jump.

00:12:42.190 --> 00:12:43.487
A gravity jump?

00:12:44.225 --> 00:12:45.556
What's a gravity jump?

00:12:47.128 --> 00:12:49.824
Just let the planetoid's
gravity carry you in.

00:12:50.164 --> 00:12:52.962
Let it draw you in as close
as possible! Don't be scared!

00:12:54.402 --> 00:12:56.370
Emi, get your nose
up a little more.

00:12:56.838 --> 00:12:58.271
Yumi, your speed's dropping!

00:12:58.573 --> 00:13:01.175
If you blow your approach to
the planetoid, you're dead!

00:13:01.175 --> 00:13:01.971
Yes, sir!

00:13:02.243 --> 00:13:05.178
Never mind answering me!
Concentrate on flying the planes!

00:13:05.446 --> 00:13:05.969
Yes, sir!

00:13:18.259 --> 00:13:20.727
They'll be hitting
perigee in ten seconds!

00:13:24.265 --> 00:13:25.197
Five...

00:13:25.266 --> 00:13:26.198
Four...

00:13:26.267 --> 00:13:27.199
Three...

00:13:27.268 --> 00:13:28.530
Two...

00:13:28.603 --> 00:13:30.503
Now! Full throttle!

00:13:49.290 --> 00:13:50.314
They broke out!

00:13:50.458 --> 00:13:51.322
It worked!

00:13:52.260 --> 00:13:53.488
HURRAY!

00:13:56.497 --> 00:13:58.260
Man, you really
had me worried there.

00:13:59.367 --> 00:14:04.600
Hey, I hope this teaches you
never to ask to fly fighters again!

00:14:06.474 --> 00:14:08.601
Hey, girls! Answer me!

00:14:10.311 --> 00:14:11.505
Oh, my God!

00:14:19.620 --> 00:14:21.554
They boosted straight
into the asteroids!

00:14:21.923 --> 00:14:23.356
What are asteroids?

00:14:44.345 --> 00:14:45.903
Metal detected ahead.

00:15:06.434 --> 00:15:10.666
No... After they missed
crashing into the planetoid!

00:15:10.872 --> 00:15:12.464
Damn it, it's not fair!

00:15:23.217 --> 00:15:25.117
I killed them...

00:15:26.654 --> 00:15:30.317
If I'd just taught
them how to fly properly...

00:15:30.525 --> 00:15:32.356
...then this never
would have happened!

00:15:39.400 --> 00:15:44.633
Damn it all! I don't deserve
to be called an ace pilot!

00:15:54.682 --> 00:15:56.741
I couldn't save them!

00:15:57.018 --> 00:15:58.952
How dare I call this
my battlefield!

00:15:59.253 --> 00:16:01.221
How dare I call
space glorious!

00:16:28.416 --> 00:16:30.850
Mr. Kojiro!
Are you all right?

00:16:31.252 --> 00:16:34.016
You should keep your eyes
on where you're flying!

00:16:34.455 --> 00:16:36.787
Yumi... Emi...

00:16:41.729 --> 00:16:44.960
I don't believe it.
This is their first flight?

00:16:46.767 --> 00:16:47.995
Natural talent!

00:16:49.804 --> 00:16:53.570
God gave those two girls
natural flying skill!

00:16:55.076 --> 00:16:58.239
It must have awakened when
they did the gravity jump!

00:16:59.113 --> 00:17:01.047
That's the only explanation!

00:17:03.084 --> 00:17:06.349
Damn it, how could
they do this to me?

00:17:34.982 --> 00:17:36.108
Mr. Kojiro!

00:17:36.284 --> 00:17:38.775
We did it!
We really did it!

00:17:40.221 --> 00:17:41.483
A promise is a promise.

00:17:41.989 --> 00:17:45.720
You aren't getting
into a cockpit again.

00:17:45.826 --> 00:17:47.225
Huh? But why?

00:17:47.395 --> 00:17:50.159
That's not fair!
We finally learned how to fly!

00:17:51.399 --> 00:17:53.560
I'm starting your training
over on the simulator.

00:17:54.101 --> 00:17:56.968
You won't hold a flight
stick again until I say so.

00:17:57.438 --> 00:17:58.132
You got that?

00:18:00.107 --> 00:18:00.630
Yes, sir!

00:18:23.130 --> 00:18:26.122
Those two are going
to be great pilots.

00:18:26.200 --> 00:18:26.825
What?

00:18:27.168 --> 00:18:30.001
They don't fly like it's
their first time behind a stick.

00:18:31.005 --> 00:18:33.371
I couldn't believe the
natural skill they showed.

00:18:33.541 --> 00:18:35.941
They really have
that much talent?

00:18:36.177 --> 00:18:40.136
Captain... Captain, how could
you know about their talent?

00:18:40.381 --> 00:18:43.544
They flunked out on
the Force's aptitude test.

00:18:45.553 --> 00:18:46.178
Simple!

00:18:46.587 --> 00:18:49.055
My keen, bright eyes saw it!

00:18:52.893 --> 00:18:56.192
Huh? You want me to
find your talents, Yuriko?

00:18:56.464 --> 00:18:58.557
Yes, could you, please?

00:18:59.133 --> 00:19:04.833
Like you did when you saw the
Hanner sisters' piloting skills.

00:19:06.207 --> 00:19:09.665
Hmm... It's okay by me.
Let's try it!

00:19:13.948 --> 00:19:19.181
If he really has the ability to
see the hidden talents in people...

00:19:19.253 --> 00:19:22.154
...then he deserves
to be the captain.

00:19:24.959 --> 00:19:25.891
Got it!

00:19:28.963 --> 00:19:31.557
Well, Yuriko, you're not
cut out to be a soldier.

00:19:31.766 --> 00:19:34.894
So I think marrying me,
having lots of children...

00:19:34.969 --> 00:19:38.461
...and making a happy home
is the best course for you.

00:19:46.480 --> 00:19:50.416
I was a fool to get my
hopes up about this idiot!

00:19:52.053 --> 00:19:55.580
You asked me to look,
so I answered truthfully...

00:19:55.656 --> 00:19:56.213
IDIOT!

00:20:15.276 --> 00:20:17.369
Now beginning
targeting practice.

00:20:18.012 --> 00:20:19.775
Difficulty level is
set to class-A special.

00:20:20.014 --> 00:20:22.915
If you don't shoot this down,
your name will be...

00:20:22.983 --> 00:20:25.611
...recorded in history as a
disgraced former pilot, Kojiro.

00:20:47.908 --> 00:20:50.968
Those two will
become great pilots.

00:20:52.213 --> 00:20:54.738
Even though they flunked
the Force's aptitude test.

00:21:20.074 --> 00:21:20.870
Gotcha!

00:21:26.313 --> 00:21:27.803
You finally did it, Kojiro!

00:21:28.048 --> 00:21:32.280
But the data shows you switched
your targeter off. Did you?

00:21:32.353 --> 00:21:35.220
I sure did. I switched
the targeting system off.

00:21:35.756 --> 00:21:39.522
I don't believe it.
Why did you try it that way?

00:21:40.127 --> 00:21:42.322
No reason.

00:21:43.431 --> 00:21:46.093
Call it... inspiration.

00:22:13.027 --> 00:22:13.994
The Irresponsible Captain Tylor
Next Episode

00:22:16.530 --> 00:22:19.727
A woman may be a soldier, but
that soldier is still a woman.

00:22:20.067 --> 00:22:21.669
If we really understood
how women think...

00:22:21.669 --> 00:22:23.364
...we wouldn't be working here!

00:22:23.604 --> 00:22:25.765
Next time, "In Demotion
Does a Woman Bloom."

00:22:25.873 --> 00:22:26.740
Filming is Job 1!
